{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L1BvbHljYXJwJTIwJTI4MjAxNSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Polycarp","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/ji5kI51joPnHSEZTV4UEDXaHcMe.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xfDyYZnNr7wjh6xBRe2qi7LX1Vq.jpg","description":"Anna, a young slave girl, is rescued and adopted by Christians in 2ND Century Smyrna, and befriended by their aged bishop, Polycarp. As Anna is taught by Polycarp and her new family, she struggles to reconcile her beliefs with those of the Christians. When the Roman proconsul demands that all citizens worship Caesar to show their allegiance to Rome, Polycarp and the Christians must find courage to stand for their faith against the growing threat of persecution. Anna is forced to come to grips with the truth and choose whom she is willing to live, and die for.\n\nReleased 24 Jun 2015 · United States of America · Language: English · 94 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2015","genres":["History","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.9","runtime":"94 min","cast":["Garry Nation","Eliya Hurt","Rusty Martin","Justin Lewis","Jerica Henline","Courtney Vetter","Gary Bosek","Radek Lord"],"director":["Joe Henline"],"released":"2015-06-24T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Perfect Love Casts Out Fear","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Joe Henline","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/t7pNuCC2u29gFLwdzl8o2PbbSRD.jpg"},{"name":"Garry Nation","character":"Polycarp","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eUc91B7Gt4o1K5XNA3hIKHJ3GjI.jpg"},{"name":"Eliya Hurt","character":"Anna"},{"name":"Rusty Martin","character":"Germanicus","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/htx48rmgGEyUzqp1rlU7EAZo2ym.jpg"},{"name":"Justin Lewis","character":"Justin"},{"name":"Jerica Henline","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/d3kndyIEgpyiuT0hf96QH7JQrv5.jpg"},{"name":"Courtney Vetter"},{"name":"Gary Bosek","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w